        "width": 540,
        "height": 230,
        "content": "## Snapshot Shopify SKU prices\nCreate a Header Auth credential: name **Authorization**, value **Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN**. Keep it in n8n credentials, not workflow JSON. Test manually, inspect the rows, then enable the disabled schedule only if you want recurring paid runs.\n\nMatch by store and stable variant ID; availability does not give stock quantity.\n\n[Actor and pricing](https://apify.com/axiorasolutions/shopify-variant-scraper) · [Try existing Apify example](https://apify.com/axiorasolutions/shopify-variant-scraper/examples/axiora-shopify-product-variant-csv)"
